{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlytop"]}],"metadata":{"title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyTop","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL23MXLSystemRelationNumberO7onlyTopyA2CmF","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onlyTop","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"case","roleHeading":"Case"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the top part of the current system."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onlyTop","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyTop","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The system-relation-number type distinguishes measure numbers that are associated with a system rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the particular part where the element appears. A value of only-top or only-bottom indicates that the number","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"should appear only on the top or bottom part of the current system, respectively. A value of also-top or also-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bottom indicates that the number should appear on both the current part and the top or bottom part of the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current system, respectively. If these values appear in a score, when parts are created the number should only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appear once in this part, not twice. A value of none indicates that the number is associated only with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current part, not with the system."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber/onlyTop":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyTop","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlytop","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyTop"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the top part of the current system."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyTop","type":"topic"}}}